positionModifiers.description:
Map class names to positions, for example:
{
  top: styles.modifiers.top,
  bottom: styles.modifiers.bottom,
  left: styles.modifiers.left,
  right: styles.modifiers.right
} (Type: {
    top?: string;
    right?: string;
    bottom?: string;
    left?: string;
    topStart?: string;
    topEnd?: string;
    bottomStart?: string;
    bottomEnd?: string;
    leftStart?: string;
    leftEnd?: string;
    rightStart?: string;
    rightEnd?: string;
  })
